5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm going to find the werewolf and win!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Let's start by observing everyone's behavior. Since it's the first day, we have no information.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. A calm and rational approach is best for now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready! I'll protect everyone and find the bad guy!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll just watch and listen for now.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Minako, you sound like a teacher! Are you the leader?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,I just prefer to keep things organized. Does anyone have a strategy for voting?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Victoria,,Perhaps we should look for contradictions in how people react to accusations.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,That sounds too slow. We should just be bold!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Being too bold can be dangerous, Takumi.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm going to guess who it is! Maybe it's Victoria because she's so quiet!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, guessing without evidence is counterproductive.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Victoria,,I am simply observing. It is not a sign of guilt.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,Sakura's just joking around. Don't take it seriously.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
