31,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning everyone! Did anyone have a scary dream?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I have information. Sakura, I'm afraid you are the werewolf.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"That was very fast. Minako, are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"What?! Sakura? No way, she's just a kid!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Misaki,,A direct claim on the first day is quite a bold move.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Eh?! Me?! Minako, that's a mean prank! I'm just a cute girl!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minako,,I am the Seer. My divination was clear. Sakura is the werewolf.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"If Minako is the Seer, the logic is simple. We must execute Sakura.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I don't know... maybe the Seer is actually the werewolf trying to trick us?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"It's possible, but Minako's composure is very convincing.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm a villager! I promise! Please don't believe her!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, if you doubt me, you risk letting the werewolf stay.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"The risk of losing a villager is high, but the Seer's information is our only concrete lead.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I hate this! But if Minako is really the Seer, we have to do it.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I agree. I'll trust Minako's result.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Nooo! This is unfair! I'm too cute to be the werewolf!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
